 to Gallery.<br>* Fast download speeds.<br>* You can Pause/Resume/Cancel downloads.<br>* Resume failed downloads.<br>* Check progress in the download bar.<br>* Support all formats, MP4, WEBM, OGG, M4S, TS.<br>* Download videos and social media clips in HD quality from all social websites<br>* Download unlimited videos for free<br>* HD / 2K / 4K videos download supported<br><br>NOTE : Download Hub doesn&#39;t support youtube downloads to comply with play store policy.<br><br>disclaimer : Please get the permission from the owner before you repost videos.Any unauthorized actions (e.g. re-posting or downloading of contents) and/or violations of intellectual property rights is the sole responsibility of the user.<br>* Downloading files protected by copyright is prohibited and regulated by the law of the country.",
